    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114923" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῡσό-νομος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>feeding in gold, very
				rich,</i>
			v. l. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσόγονος</span>
			(q. v.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> perh. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσοῦς, ποτήρια</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PBaden</u>
				54.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(v A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> parox. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νόμος, ὁ,</span>
			<i>distributor of gold,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. τῶν λαμπαδιστῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1068.11
				</span></i>
			 (Patmos, <span class="entity">iii/ii B. C.</span>).</div>
